        "heading_wHjXW7": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Where to find us",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_nkxF6w": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The Home Spa prides itself on delivering luxurious 5-star spa services directly to the doorstep of its esteemed clientele. Currently, our services cater to residents in four prominent cities across the UAE, including Abu Dhabi, Dubai, Al Ain, Sharjah and Ajman. However, our ambitious vision extends far beyond these boundaries, with strategic plans in place to extend our reach to the remaining Emirates and eventually across the broader Middle East region. </p><p>In September 2022, we opened our fourth branch in Sharjah independently. This expansion not only signifies our commitment to growth and excellence but also underscores our dedication to meeting the evolving needs and preferences of our valued customers.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
